{
  "slug": "postman",
  "name": "Postman",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full API lifecycle management for Claude Code. Sync collections, generate client code, discover APIs, run tests, create mocks, publish docs, and audit security. Powered by the Postman MCP Server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **1 agent**, **15 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `agent-ready-apis` (Knowledge about AI agent API compatibility), `deploy-flow` (Deploy a Postman Flow so it becomes triggerable, using the Postman CLI), `generate-spec` (Generate or update an OpenAPI 3.0 spec from code), `get-flow-run` (Inspect a Postman Flow run by Run ID using the Postman CLI — per-block logs, failing block, and…), `list-flows` (List Postman Flows in a workspace using the Postman CLI, and resolve a flow name to its 24-character…), `postman-cli` (Postman CLI reference and git sync file structure knowledge - provides context for CLI-based commands (send-request, generate-spec, run-collection,…), `postman-context` (Discover, explore, install, and generate client code from APIs in Postman), `postman-knowledge` (Postman concepts and MCP tool guidance), and 3 more\n- **Agents** (1): `readiness-analyzer` (Analyze any API or OpenAPI spec for AI agent compatibility — 48 checks across 8 pillars, with scoring…)\n- **Commands** (15): `deploy-flow` (Deploy a Postman Flow so it becomes triggerable, proposing and confirming a trigger path), `docs` (Generate, improve, and publish API documentation from Postman collections), `generate-spec` (Generate or update an OpenAPI spec from your codebase), `get-flow-run` (Inspect a Postman Flow run by its Run ID — per-block logs, failing block, and status), `learn` (Search the Postman Learning Center for how-to guidance, feature explanations, and suggested workflows), `list-flows` (List Postman Flows in a workspace and resolve a flow name to its 24-character ID), `mock` (Create Postman mock servers for frontend development), `run-collection` (Run Postman collection tests using the CLI), and 7 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `postman`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install postman@claude-plugins-official` from `Postman-Devrel/postman-claude-code-plugin`.",
